@identityHost = http://localhost:8080
@reportingHost = http://localhost:8085
@email = reporting@example.com
@password = Reporting123!
@walletId = 33333333-3333-3333-3333-333333333333
@ownerId = 11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111
@accessToken = paste-access-token-here

### Service information
GET {{reportingHost}}/
Accept: application/json

### Liveness check
GET {{reportingHost}}/health/live
Accept: application/json

### Readiness check (MongoDB and messaging provider)
GET {{reportingHost}}/health/ready
Accept: application/json

### Register an Identity user
POST {{identityHost}}/api/identity-users
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "{{email}}",
  "password": "{{password}}"
}

### Get a Reporting access token, then copy access_token above
POST {{identityHost}}/connect/token
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

client_id=vault-swagger&client_secret=vault-swagger-secret&grant_type=password&username={{email}}&password={{password}}&scope=vault.reporting.api

### Get wallet activity report
GET {{reportingHost}}/api/reports/wallets/{{walletId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Accept: application/json

### Get reports by owner
GET {{reportingHost}}/api/reports/owners/{{ownerId}}/wallets
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Accept: application/json
